# Repo allowlist for the pre-push scanner (~/.agents/scripts/prepush-scan.py).
# Format: <path-glob> [category].  Category-scoped only: every other rule
# (sensitive filenames, known token formats, private keys) still applies to
# these paths.  See ~/.agents/prepush-guard/README.md.

# uBlock Origin's identifiers are long camelCase names, and any quoted string
# over 24 chars drawn from [A-Za-z0-9_-] with two character classes clears the
# 4.2-bit entropy threshold.  Two inherited upstream identifiers trip it:
#   src/_locales/en/messages.json  popupBlockedOnThisPage_v2          (4.29)
#   src/js/contextmenu.js          uBlock0-temporarilyAllowLargeMediaElements (4.36)
# Both are public identifiers shipped in the extension, not credentials.
# The real secrets in this repo are the CRX signing key (uBlockVanced.pem)
# and .env, which are gitignored and unaffected by these two lines.
# Approved 2026-09-18.
src/_locales/en/messages.json high-entropy
src/js/contextmenu.js high-entropy
